OL,3,GNEWSAHead teacher's corruption claim
OL,4,Adismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former head teacher already jailed
OL,7,Ffor harassing a trainee has lost his
OL,8,Fcase for unfair dismissal brought
OL,9,Fagainst his former employer.
OL,11,FGregory Hill took Eastern Multi Academy
OL,12,FTrust to an employment tribunal after
OL,13,Fhe lost his job at Howard Junior School
OL,14,Fin King's Lynn, Norfolk, in 2024.
OL,16,FHe had been suspended and then sacked
OL,17,Fafter being arrested at the school for
OL,18,Fharassing a 23-year-old trainee. He was
OL,19,Flater found guilty and sentenced to 20
OL,20,Fweeks in prison.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
